 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add `v1.FilesService.Upload`, which uploads a local file from a file name and
+  an `io.Reader` and builds the `multipart/form-data` body internally, mirroring
+  `CallLogsService.AddRecording`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- File uploads via `Upload` now buffer into a replayable body, so they are
+  retried on 429/5xx like other requests. Previously the only upload entry point
+  (`Files.Add`) required a caller-built body; a raw stream such as an `*os.File`
+  has no replayable body and failed on the first 429 instead of retrying. The
+  `Files.Add` documentation now calls out this limitation.
+
